      "created_at": "2014-05-12T16:38:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry if I put this in the wrong forums :(</p><p>Hello there! Drakossozh here, from the Philippines :) I will actually be headed to the US this coming month of June, and I was hoping to visit some FLGS during my stay. Unfortunately, I am not very familiar with the areas I will be visiting. Thus, the question. Can anyone suggest any FLGS in Chicago and Las Vegas? Preferably those easily reachable by bus/train/cab/whatever. FLGS are very rare here in our country :( so I was hoping I could get my fill of games when I visit. Yey!</p><p>Also, a follow up! Playing board games in a FLGS is a thing, right? Like, with just random people you meet in the store? Do they charge you to play there? Do you have to buy the game or bring the game over to the store to play? How is it done? Sorry, I am very much unfamiliar with this whole thing &gt;___&lt;</p>",
