      "cooked": "<p>There are several stores in Chicago, and it sort of depends where you are staying.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.chicagolandgames.com/\">DIce Dojo</a>&nbsp;is right next to a train stop, and has a huge area and selection to play games. They ahve different events each night, but Wednesday in Open Boardgaming with a rather large turnout each week.</p>",
